/*  Two named parameter sets of one pair (contract K3).  The bubble pressure of
    a butanol-rich liquid at 100 C under the record's preferred set (lle) and
    under the second set (probe_vle, a PROBE).  The two answers differ by the
    sets' numbers alone; the run prints the set each used in its [builder]
    line and in the resolved view.  Run-only + KPI golden. */
application   choupoProps;
description   "A pair record of two named NRTL sets (nButanol + water): the bubble pressure under the preferred set and under a second, case-selected set";
verbosity     2;
